        "original_id": "a3098bcc-c1e9-5259-97e1-0230ee352e13",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fritz Tornow, Adolf Hitler, Eva Braun, Martin Bormann\n- Animals: Blondi, Blondi's puppies, Eva Braun's dogs, Tornow's dachshund\n\nFacts:\n- In 1941, Martin Bormann gave Blondi, a German Shepherd puppy, to Adolf Hitler.\n- Blondi lived from 1941 to 29 April 1945.\n- Fritz Tornow was responsible for caring for Adolf Hitler's German Shepherd Blondi, Blondi's puppies, and Eva Braun's dogs.\n- Fritz Tornow also had his own pet dachshund.",
